  "talents_description": {
    "modifier_doom_1_0": "Increase Scorched Earth Movement Speed: 6%/12%",
    "modifier_doom_1_1": "Increase Scorched Earth Movement Speed: <b><font color='#eabe10'>6%</font></b>/12%",
    "modifier_doom_1_2": "Increase Scorched Earth Movement Speed: 6%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>12%</font></b>",
    "modifier_doom_2_0": "New Active Ability: Creep DOOM \n\n Brings doom upon a creep: on cast it dispels positive effects, then for a duration deals periodic damage, prevents casting abilities, and prevents any form of health regeneration. \n\n Damage: 80/130/180 \n Duration: 3 sec. \n Cast Range: 500 \n Cooldown: 20 sec.",
    "modifier_doom_2_1": "New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Creep DOOM</font></b> \n\n Brings doom upon a creep: on cast it dispels positive effects, then for a duration deals periodic damage, prevents casting abilities, and prevents any form of health regeneration. \n\n Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>80</font></b>/130/180 \n Duration: 3 sec. \n Cast Range: 500 \n Cooldown: 20 sec.",
    "modifier_doom_2_2": "New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Creep DOOM</font></b> \n\n Brings doom upon a creep: on cast it dispels positive effects, then for a duration deals periodic damage, prevents casting abilities, and prevents any form of health regeneration. \n\n Damage: 80/<b><font color='#eabe10'>130</font></b>/180 \n Duration: 3 sec. \n Cast Range: 500 \n Cooldown: 20 sec.",
    "modifier_doom_2_3": "New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Creep DOOM</font></b> \n\n Brings doom upon a creep: on cast it dispels positive effects, then for a duration deals periodic damage, prevents casting abilities, and prevents any form of health regeneration. \n\n Damage: 80/130/<b><font color='#eabe10'>180</font></b> \n Duration: 3 sec. \n Cast Range: 500 \n Cooldown: 20 sec.",
    "modifier_doom_3_0": "DOOM and Creep DOOM affect an area within a radius of 300 around the target.",
    "modifier_doom_3_1": "DOOM and Creep DOOM affect an area within a radius of <b><font color='#eabe10'>300</font></b> around the target.",
    "modifier_doom_4_0": "Increase DOOM Damage: 1/2/3 per 300 Max Health",
    "modifier_doom_4_1": "Increase DOOM Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b>/2/3 per 300 Max Health",
    "modifier_doom_4_2": "Increase DOOM Damage: 1/<b><font color='#eabe10'>2</font></b>/3 per 300 Max Health",
    "modifier_doom_4_3": "Increase DOOM Damage: 1/2/<b><font color='#eabe10'>3</font></b> per 300 Max Health",
    "modifier_doom_5_0": "DOOM deals Pure Damage on first hit: 1%/2%/3% from Max Health \n\n Cooldown for each target: 5 sec.",
    "modifier_doom_5_1": "DOOM deals Pure Damage on first hit: <b><font color='#eabe10'>1%</font></b>/2%/3% from Max Health \n\n Cooldown for each target: 5 sec.",
    "modifier_doom_5_2": "DOOM deals Pure Damage on first hit: 1%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>2%</font></b>/3% from Max Health \n\n Cooldown for each target: 5 sec.",
    "modifier_doom_5_3": "DOOM deals Pure Damage on first hit: 1%/2%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>3%</font></b> from Max Health \n\n Cooldown for each target: 5 sec.",
    "modifier_doom_6_0": "DOOM disables the target's Passive Abilities.",
    "modifier_doom_6_1": "DOOM <b><font color='#eabe10'>disables</font></b> the target's Passive Abilities.",
    "modifier_doom_7_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Movement Speed Reduction: 175</font></b> \n\n DOOM becomes a Passive Ability on a Hero with 300 AoE. Disabled by break.",
    "modifier_doom_7_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Movement Speed Reduction: 175</font></b> \n\n DOOM becomes a <b><font color='#eabe10'>Passive Ability</font></b> on a Hero with 300 AoE. Disabled by break.",
    "modifier_doom_8_0": "Infernal Blade procs on random creeps within a 300 radius: 1/2",
    "modifier_doom_8_1": "Infernal Blade procs on random creeps within a 300 radius: <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b>/2",
